{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19115","headline":"洛中初冬拜表有怀上京故人 · 刘禹锡","name":"洛中初冬拜表有怀上京故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤楼南面控三条，拜表郎官早渡桥。\n清洛晓光铺碧簟，上阳霜叶剪红绡。\n省门簪组初成列，云路鸳鸾想退朝。\n寄谢殷懃九天侣，抢榆水击各逍遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}